# driver (drivers/misc/ark_display.c, the ARKDISP_GET_SCREEN_INFO/
# ARKDISP_GET_SET_VDE_CFG misc device MsnCoreApp depends on at
# startup to avoid a ~9KB fallback/default-init branch -- see that
# file's own header comment) had never been captured in this
# defconfig at all, so it silently vanished the moment --defconfig
# got force-reapplied for the ITU656 work, and has been missing from
# every kernel build since -- including the one with today's earlier
# ARKDISP_SET_VDE_CFG real-register-write changes (fd6e03414), which
# have therefore never actually run on real hardware yet.
